Good Job Mr. Jobs

Author:   Code + Graphics: KD, Music: Ramos
Category: PC Demo
System:   PC Windows
Language: Java 24

Instructions:

Make sure you have Java 24 or higher installed
Simply double-click the JAR file
or run from command line:
java -jar GoodJobMrJobs.jar 

Description:

Some important anniversary in the history of computers is comming soon...

Tools used:
IntelliJ for Java coding (+Maven, +Git)
Gimp for simple graphics processing
Online Sequencer for simple chiptunes, GoatTracker for more advanced, retro-style chiptunes.
Narakeet for text to speech
